<DIV class="box">
<DIV class="t_news"><IMG src="../../images/weizhi.png" style="margin-top: 7px;float: left;margin-right: 10px">&nbsp;<b style="color:#e6282f;">您的位置：</b>
                        <a href="../../index.htm">主页</a>
                >
                <a href="../../kx.htm">西电学子</a>

<UL class="swap"></UL></DIV></DIV>
